  factsRows:[['所在区域','泰国素叻他尼府考索地区'],['管理单位','泰国国家公园、野生动物与植物保护厅（国家公园范围内）'],['开放与通行','依具体地点、路线、天气而异；出发前向园方核实'],['门票及向导费用','以官方现行收费与所订行程包含项目为准'],['规划原则','尽量安排日间活动，并为交通及天气预留时间']],
  steps:['确认具体景点与出发点，国家公园入口和湖区码头不可混为一谈','查询天气、园方公告、路线开放状态与是否需要预约','抵达对应起点，沿获准的步道或向导路线前进','放慢脚步观察主要景观，不追赶动物或擅自离开路线','在允许时间或约定交通接驳前返回'],
  safetyText:'穿防滑鞋，携带饮水、雨具并遵守封闭告示。没有合适许可与向导时，不要进入涨水溪流、洞穴或无标识林道；带走垃圾。',
  photoText:'利用树木轮廓和自然光构图。雨林需防潮，乘船时固定相机；拍摄动物避免闪光灯，不占据步道。',
  transportText:'使用景点全名进行地图搜索，并向当地经营者确认地图标记与实际集合点。部分体验无法直接驾车抵达。以下是名称搜索链接，并非已核实的 Google 地点 ID。',
  faqs:[['可以自行前往吗？','村庄设施及部分公共观景点可自行前往；雨林步道、洞穴与湖上活动可能需要向导或预约，应以现场规定为准。'],['需要停留多久？','取决于天气、接驳和活动类型。尤其是雨林与水库跨区游览，应预留充足时间。'],['雨天适合游览吗？','强降雨可能造成步道湿滑、水位上涨、洞穴或船游关闭。遵从园方通知并准备替代行程。']],
  sourceText:'开放、收费和安全限制以泰国国家公园管理部门及泰国旅游局的最新公开信息为准；地图仅用于辅助定位。',
 }
}[lang];
const jsonLd = {'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'TouristDestination',name,description:intro,url:`${siteConfig.domain}/${lang}/explore/${slug}/`,touristType:'Nature and responsible tourism',containedInPlace:{'@id':`${siteConfig.domain}/#attraction`}};
---
<BaseLayout lang={lang} title={`${name} | Khao Sok Guide`} description={intro} messages={messages} path={`explore/${slug}`} extraJsonLd={[jsonLd]}>
  <Header lang={lang} messages={messages} path={`explore/${slug}`} />
  <main class="bg-ivory">
    <section class="pt-28 pb-14 bg-teakDeep text-ivory"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5">
      <p class="text-gold text-sm tracking-widest uppercase">Khao Sok National Park · {entry[1]}</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl mt-3">{name}</h1><p class="mt-3 text-xl text-goldBright">{subtitle}</p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-ivory/80 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">{intro}</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-7"><a href={map} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="rounded-full bg-gold text-teak px-5 py-2 font-medium">Google Maps ↗</a><a href={`/${lang}/explore/`} class="rounded-full border border-gold/50 px-5 py-2">{copy.related} →</a></div>
    </div></section>
    <section class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5 py-14 space-y-11">
      <article><h2 class="font-display text-3xl text-teak">{copy.overview} {name}</h2><p class="mt-3 text-ink/85 leading-relaxed">{copy.aboutText}</p></article>
      <article class="rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-gold bg-white p-6 md:p-8"><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-teak/60">Khao Sok · {entry[1]}</p><h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-teak mt-2">{labels.management}</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-ink/85">{management}</p></article>
      <article><h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-teak">{copy.facts} — {name}</h2><dl class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-5">{visitorFacts.map(({label,value}) => <div class="rounded-xl border border-teak/15 bg-white p-4"><dt class="text-xs text-teak/70">{label}</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-ink/90">{value}</dd></div>)}</dl></article>
      <article><h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-teak">{labels.story}</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink/85">{specific}</p></article>
      {detail.photos.length > 0 && <article><h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-teak">{labels.photos}</h2><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mt-5">{detail.photos.map(photo => <figure class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-white border border-teak/10"><img src={`/explore-photos/${photo}.jpg`} alt={photoCaptions[photo]} loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full h-60 object-cover" /><figcaption class="p-3 text-sm text-ink/75">{photoCaptions[photo]} <a class="block text-xs underline mt-1" href={photoSources[photo].url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{photoSources[photo].label} ↗</a></figcaption></figure>)}</div><p class="text-xs text-ink/60 mt-3">{labels.photoNote} · {labels.gallerySource}</p></article>}
      <article><h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-teak">{copy.planning}</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">{copy.planText}</p></article>
      <article><h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-teak">{copy.highlights}</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">{copy.highlightsText}</p></article>
      <article><h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-teak">{copy.route}</h2><ol class="mt-4 space-y-3">{copy.steps.map((step,i) => <li class="flex gap-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-teak/10 p-4"><span class="text-gold font-bold">{i+1}.</span><span>{step}</span></li>)}</ol></article>
      <article><h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-teak">{copy.safety}</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">{copy.safetyText}</p></article>
      <article><h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-teak">{copy.photos}</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">{copy.photoText}</p></article>
      <article><h2 class="font-display text-2xl text-teak">{copy.transport}</h2><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">{copy.transportText}</p><p class="mt-3 text-sm text-teak/70">{labels.exact}: {detail.map}, Thailand</p><a href={map} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block mt-4 text-teak underline">{entry[1]} · Google Maps ↗</a></article>
    </section>
    <section class="bg-teakDeep text-ivory py-14"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5"><h2 class="font-display text-3xl">{copy.faq}</h2><div class="mt-6 space-y-3">{copy.faqs.map(([q,a]) => <details class="border border-gold/25 p-5 rounded-xl"><summary class="cursor-pointer">{q}</summary><p class="text-ivory/75 mt-3">{a}</p></details>)}</div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl mt-10">{copy.source}</h2><p class="text-ivory/75 mt-3">{copy.sourceText}</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 mt-4 text-goldBright"><a href="https://www.dnp.go.th/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DNP ↗</a><a href="https://www.tourismthailand.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tourism Thailand ↗</a></div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl mt-10">{copy.related}</h2><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-4">{related.map(e => <a class="border border-gold/40 rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm" href={`/${lang}/explore/${e[0]}/`}>{lang === 'th' ? e[2] : lang === 'zh' ? e[4] : e[1]} →</a>)}</div>
      <div class="mt-8"><a class="underline text-goldBright" href={`/${lang}/explore/`}>{copy.related}: 30 {lang === 'th' ? 'หัวข้อ' : lang === 'zh' ? '个专题' : 'guides'} →</a></div>
    </div></section>
  </main>
  <Footer lang={lang} messages={messages} path={`explore/${slug}`} />
</BaseLayout>
